*******
******* Stand-in for the Language Environment CEEIGZCT copybook, used
******* only when no CEEIGZCT is found in the copybook folders. Programs
******* copy it under the 8-byte condition token value of a feedback
******* code. It has only CEE000, the condition IBM documents for a
******* service that completed successfully (all zeros); IBM's copybook
******* defines a condition name for every LE message. This is not
******* IBM's copybook.
           88  CEE000    VALUE X'0000000000000000'.
